      "writtenOn": "2026-08-27T14:59:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This reads Transfer-Encoding off a request the decoder may already have rejected. A POST carrying both Content-Length and Transfer-Encoding: chunked keeps the chunked header but arrives with a failed DecoderResult, so it is selected as STREAMING and routed past the aggregator. The HTTPServerSession (the only handler that turns a failure into a 400) accepts FullHttpRequest ONLY, so the client gets no response at all. Could we add request.decoderResult().isSuccess() to the condition? Or at least a FIXME if that\u0027s problematic for some reason.",
      "revId": "6ff0a561f35bf5f20bee591a31b9f4adde35b99f",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2bf16da7_33d5782c",
        "filename": "transport/transport-http/src/main/java/org/opendaylight/netconf/transport/http/Http1RequestDispatcher.java",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 164,
      "author": {
        "id": 8324
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-08-27T14:59:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we\u0027re only switching between 2 cases, this can be easily replaced with a simple If-else and the suppression can be dropped.",
      "revId": "6ff0a561f35bf5f20bee591a31b9f4adde35b99f",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
    },
